      "message": "test(post): the EDM templates are test fixtures until their posts ship\n\nEvery shipped .mch must be in the built-in library and every library\nmachine must have a post (machine_library); no EDM post exists until\n#533 / #542, so the empty wire and sinker templates move to\ncrates/app/tests/edm/ and join the library with their kind's first post.\n\nRefs #530\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
